          "code": "# Proposed document processing pipeline\n1. File Upload → Security Scan\n2. Content Extraction → Text/Metadata\n3. Chunking Strategy → 1000 tokens with 200 overlap\n4. Vector Embedding → OpenAI text-embedding-ada-002\n5. Storage → ChromaDB with metadata indexing\n6. Retrieval → Similarity search with reranking"
        }
